<html>
<head>
  <script type="application/jay-headfull"
          src="../../components/section/section"
          contract="../../components/section/section.jay-contract"
          names="section"></script>
  <script type="application/jay-data" contract="./page.jay-contract"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <div>
    <h1>{pageTitle}</h1>
    <!-- Realistic nested composition: a Tier 3 button inside a Tier 2 card inside a Tier 3 section.
         The page only composes <jay:section>; card and button are encapsulated inside it. The
         section's title threads down as the card heading and then the button label, proving data
         and coordinates flow correctly through alternating Tier 3 / Tier 2 / Tier 3 boundaries. -->
    <jay:section ref="section" title="Featured" />
  </div>
</body>
</html>
